  <item>
    <title>003：如果你和我喜欢一样的剧，咱们就是好朋友啦！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6585258e3d1caa927af2cb85</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6585258e3d1caa927af2cb85</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 22 Dec 2023 05:58:36 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>2023年好像“咻”的一下就过完了，作为一个重度电视儿童，我在沙发里看一部电影或者剧，对我来讲就是最好的解压方式。今年年中，由于我的单程通勤变成了一个小时，所以在地铁上也读完了好几本书。</span></p><span></span><p><span>现在短视频，碎片知识好像已经充斥了我们的生活，但是短暂刺激大脑，没有上下文，不谈因果关系的内容，真的能让我们有所思考么？所以今年我也在试着减少刷短视频的时间，静下心来，把时间花在好电影或者好书上。包括开始做播客，都是我希望自己能够更加专注，push自己深入思考的一次尝试。</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天就想来和大家聊一聊我超级推荐的电视剧，电影，书籍和综艺。欢迎和我喜欢看同样内容的小伙伴在评论区和我讨论！</span></p><span></span><p><span>（剪辑完这期播客真的好想把我的推荐全都再刷一遍，全都太好看了🥹）</span></p><span></span><p><span>「画重点」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="119">01:59</a> &nbsp;《漫长的季节》的爹味争议</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="338">05:38</a> &nbsp;《涉过愤怒的海》空心的家庭，空心的爱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="545">09:05</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;香芹又青了是如何通过分析《知否》描述弑父的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="824">13:44</a> &nbsp;《鬼家人》是一部堆砌了各种元素的成功商业片</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="872">14:32</a> &nbsp;《谁先爱上他的》同妻，男小三和骗婚gay，到底谁更委屈？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1197">19:57</a> &nbsp;《她和她和她》他性侵你的时候，你为什么不拒绝？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1525">25:25</a> &nbsp;《A Taxi Driver》小人物揭露韩国政府的大谎言</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1560">26:00</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;美国编剧集体罢工，如果打工人拧成一股绳，资本还能不能赢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1799">29:59</a> &nbsp;忍不住解释的女性，和随意大小爹的男性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2128">35:28</a> &nbsp;《我，厌男》反对男权，但并不是厌恶所有男人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2274">37:54</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;就算女性不打拳，男性也不会因此和我们站在同一战线的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2389">39:49</a> 《向前一步》外在声音潜移默化给了女性的内心哪些束缚</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2736">45:36</a> &nbsp;琐碎推荐（《怪奇物语》《最后生还者》等）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3074">51:14</a> &nbsp;提前祝大家2024都能勇敢地向前一步！</span></p><span></span><p><span>「拓展材料」</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/KclGJlc_4duHyyKEd-L2HQ" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/KclGJlc_4duHyyKEd-L2HQ"><strong><span>逆风吐槽《漫长的季节》，这漫长的爹味</span></strong></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/bZk0JHQhy-AKEOfSV7iLdw" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/bZk0JHQhy-AKEOfSV7iLdw"><strong><span>关于“爹味创作”争议的几个补充说明</span></strong></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/oo1Pobt0ZX2hvy4mjGJrcw" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/oo1Pobt0ZX2hvy4mjGJrcw"><strong><span>《涉过愤怒的海》与三种人格障碍</span></strong></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1k94y137K5/" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1k94y137K5/"><span>香芹又青了：为什么盛明兰完成了有效弑父，知否主角团的弑父暗线</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://movie.douban.com/review/9741161/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/review/9741161/"><span>一条专访导演：我的爸爸是个同性恋，他死后把钱都留给了男友</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://wiki.mbalib.com/wiki/%E6%B5%B7%E5%BE%B7%E7%9A%84%E5%B9%B3%E8%A1%A1%E7%90%86%E8%AE%BA" data-url="https://wiki.mbalib.com/wiki/%E6%B5%B7%E5%BE%B7%E7%9A%84%E5%B9%B3%E8%A1%A1%E7%90%86%E8%AE%BA"><span>海德的平衡理论</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/2us_zmDwoQTgpryDHcq76A" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/2us_zmDwoQTgpryDHcq76A"><span>正面连接：资本主义工会和我的罢工</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/leXOuWZ5cuCNVtBaTeRvdQ" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/leXOuWZ5cuCNVtBaTeRvdQ"><span>正面连接：</span><strong><span>一本叫《我，厌男》的书，和厌恶它的男人</span></strong></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://zh.wikipedia.org/zh-sg/%E5%86%92%E5%90%8D%E9%A0%82%E6%9B%BF%E7%97%87%E5%80%99%E7%BE%A4" data-url="https://zh.wikipedia.org/zh-sg/%E5%86%92%E5%90%8D%E9%A0%82%E6%9B%BF%E7%97%87%E5%80%99%E7%BE%A4"><span>冒充者综合征</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://dark.netflix.io/en" data-url="https://dark.netflix.io/en"><span>《暗黑》官网</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="http://xhslink.com/VK21Kx%EF%BC%8C%E5%A4%8D%E5%88%B6%E6%9C%AC%E6%9D%A1%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%EF%BC%8C%E6%89%93%E5%BC%80%E3%80%90%E5%B0%8F%E7%BA%A2%E4%B9%A6%E3%80%91App%E6%9F%A5%E7%9C%8B%E7%B2%BE%E5%BD%A9%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%EF%BC%81" data-url="http://xhslink.com/VK21Kx%EF%BC%8C%E5%A4%8D%E5%88%B6%E6%9C%AC%E6%9D%A1%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%EF%BC%8C%E6%89%93%E5%BC%80%E3%80%90%E5%B0%8F%E7%BA%A2%E4%B9%A6%E3%80%91App%E6%9F%A5%E7%9C%8B%E7%B2%BE%E5%BD%A9%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%EF%BC%81"><span>《暗黑》小红书推荐</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>「背景音乐」</span></p><span></span><p><span>再回首 by 姜育恒</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>峇里島</span></strong><span> by 李英宏</span></p><span></span><p><span>开往光州的路</span></p><span></span><p><span>Stranger Things by Kyle Dixon/ Michael Stein</span></p><span></span><p><span>Running Up That Hill by Meg Myers</span></p><span></span><p><span>「完整推荐&amp;我的评分」</span></p><span></span><p><span>电视剧</span></p><span></span><p><span>《狂飙》 8.6</span></p><span></span><p><span>《漫长的季节》 9.3</span></p><span></span><p><span>《她和她的她》8.8</span></p><span></span><p><span>《怪奇物语》9.0</span></p><span></span><p><span>《暗黑》9.4</span></p><span></span><p><span>《黑暗荣耀》8.8</span></p><span></span><p><span>《最后生还者》8.8</span></p><span></span><p><span>电影</span></p><span></span><p><span>《涉过愤怒的海》9.3</span></p><span></span><p><span>《关于我和鬼变成家人这件事》8.3</span></p><span></span><p><span>《谁先爱上他的》8.8</span></p><span></span><p><span>《子弹列车》9.0</span></p><span></span><p><span>《A Taxi Driver》9.2</span></p><span></span><p><span>综艺</span></p><span></span><p><span>《新世界虚拟货币争霸战》9.3</span></p><span></span><p><span>《森林进化论》9.0</span></p><span></span><p><span>游戏</span></p><span></span><p><span>《双人成行》9.5</span></p><span></span><p><span>书籍</span></p><span></span><p><span>《长安的荔枝》8.8</span></p><span></span><p><span>《穷爸爸富爸爸》9.2</span></p><span></span><p><span>《我，厌男》9.5</span></p><span></span><p><span>《向前一步》9.6</span></p><span></span>