    <title>001:让我来教教你《芭比》讲的是什么</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64feaad8e490c5dee5e84cf6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64feaad8e490c5dee5e84cf6</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 11 Sep 2023 05:51:18 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>💗在我录制和剪辑这期播客期间，《芭比》已经超过《超级马力欧兄弟大电影》票房成绩，登顶2023年全球票房榜。我们今天欢聚在这里，就是为了祝福女性电影越来越好，大家一起发光，发热！💗</span></p><span></span><p><span>前段时间看完电影《芭比》之后就感慨颇多！我关注的公众号和微博博主们都不约而同的推荐和分析这部真女性电影！当然，有夸赞就会有质疑，不喜欢这部电影的观众也不在少数。今天想来教教（bushi）大家这部电影到底想表达什么，围绕这部电影，讨论下我们对于女性主义的看法。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们这么多年的传统，早已经给男女定制好了不同的分工，甚至还有很大一部分人依旧认为男性就是比女性高一等，女性不该想要的太多。但是芭比世界告诉我们，不是这样的！有一个地方，所有的话语权都在女性这边，女性顶住了全部的天。男性和女都不应该为自己的性别所困，大家都can be everything！</span></p><span></span><p><span>「画重点」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="87">01:27</a> 电影基本剧情介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="302">05:02</a> 关于“男言之瘾”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="482">08:02</a> 我被男性说教的搞笑经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="563">09:23</a> 为什么男性会比女性好为人师？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="690">11:30</a> 男人不是天生的，而是造就的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="824">13:44</a> 性别歧视是一把双刃剑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1095">18:15</a> 将父权隐藏的更好，本身就提高了大众的歧视成本</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1464">24:24</a> &nbsp;我们讨厌的是“爹味”这个个性，不是男性这个性别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1714">28:34</a> 比起消失的她，芭比在大陆票房略微惨淡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1913">31:53</a> 剥开信息茧房，其实大部分人依旧认为女性最大的成就是婚姻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2456">40:56</a> 重拳出击到底能不能推进女权</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2677">44:37</a> &nbsp;我们的女性主义，也许会走向两极分化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3045">50:45</a> 我们的一点小建议</span></p><span></span><p><span>「拓展材料」</span></p><span></span><ol><span>  </span><li><span>大法官金斯伯格 &nbsp;</span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/bangumi/play/ep340570?theme=movie&amp;spm_id_from=333.337.0.0" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/bangumi/play/ep340570?theme=movie&amp;spm_id_from=333.337.0.0"><span>www.bilibili.com</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>大mia的时尚账号 《芭比》观后感 &nbsp;</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/t-ooebiJvSpkqfcTlqpKeg" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/t-ooebiJvSpkqfcTlqpKeg"><span>mp.weixin.qq.com</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>萝严肃 &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><strong><span>夭寿啦，陈思诚都打起“girls help girls”的主意啦</span></strong><span> </span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/puPZ4ZR1kVZQRD5cjvz8wg" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/puPZ4ZR1kVZQRD5cjvz8wg"><span>mp.weixin.qq.com</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>世界经济论坛 性别差异报告 </span><a href="https://www.weforum.org/reports/global-gender-gap-report-2023/" data-url="https://www.weforum.org/reports/global-gender-gap-report-2023/"><span>www.weforum.org</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>纽约时报的调研 </span><strong><span>Women’s Unpaid Labor is Worth $10,900,000,000,000</span></strong><span> </span><a href="https://www.nytimes.com/interactive/2020/03/04/opinion/women-unpaid-labor.html" data-url="https://www.nytimes.com/interactive/2020/03/04/opinion/women-unpaid-labor.html"><span>www.nytimes.com</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><br></li><span></span></ol><span></span><p><span>「背景音乐」</span></p><span></span><ol><span>  </span><li><span>Aqua - Barbie Girl (Slagter Dubstep Bootleg)</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>I’m just Ken by </span><a href="https://soundcloud.com/ryangosling-music" data-url="https://soundcloud.com/ryangosling-music"><strong><span>Ryan Gosling</span></strong></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>Pink by Lizzo</span></li><span></span></ol>]]></description>
